00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:31.131 size:88% position:44% line:92%
She's a good little boy.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.666 line:92%
I come from a long line of dads.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:38.438 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:43.076 line:92%
I was born December 8, 1979.

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.211 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
December 8th, '79.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.448 line:92%
Man, the '70s were crazy.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
