00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.653
Everybody's pooping their pants.
There's boobs everywhere.

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:54.454 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:59.325
Every nap I woke up from, poop
in my pants, boobies in my face.

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:01.928 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:06.699 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It was a different time.

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.534 size:78% position:39% line:92%
My son listens to me.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.171
And if he doesn't understand
what I'm saying, he's curious.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
Recently, I had gotten him
some ice cream,

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:16.009
and I was driving him to dro
him off at his mom's house

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:18.144 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I said, "Hey, buddy.

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:20.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe don't tell your mom
about the ice cream.

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.549 line:92%
Because you know what they say

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.717 line:92%
'Loose lips sink ships.'"

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:28.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said, "What does
'loose lips sink ships' mean?"

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.523 line:92%
I said, "I love you, man."

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:31.291 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You're so inquisitive."
You know?

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.861 line:92%
Interesting story actually

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:38.898
A gentleman set sail from Europe
a long time ago,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
looking for a new world,
a new land.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.735 line:92%
Nobody thought it existed.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he found it.
It's called America.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's where you were born, son.
You're an American.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
But what a lot of people
don't know is that

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:51.578
there was another boat tha
took off before that boat.

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:54.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it would have found Americ
first except everybody die

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:57.350
because the captain told his mom
about the ice cream.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.353 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.222 line:92%
So "loose lips sink ships.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:05.058 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:12.999 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.567 line:92%
My son witnessed a death.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
He saw a bird fly into
the window of his play room,

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.005 line:92%
and it fell to the ground.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.040 size:75% position:38%
He wanted to see it,
so we went outside.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.611
And there we were, standing over
what I knew was a dead bir

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:28.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
but what my son thought
was a bird.

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:30.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because he doesn't know what
death is.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.753
And I realized in that momen
that I might have to explain

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.889 line:92%
death to a 5-year-old boy.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:38.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it seemed like it would be
easier if I could somehow

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:41.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
gather up all of the birds
in the neighborhood

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.229 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and explain windows...

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.497 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
...than to explain death
to a 5-year-old.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.503 size:81% position:41%
"Gather 'round, birds.
I know it's a Tuesday.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.038 line:92%
I'm going to make it fast.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.072 line:92%
Let's talk about windows.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:56.676
You're going to see clear
squares and big solids.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:57.477 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Don't even try it.

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're never gonna
get to the couch.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:04.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, let's talk about
Windows 95."

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:05.051 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:10.990 size:84% position:42%
"We lost a lot of birds
to windows that year."

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
My parents conceived me
on a waterbed.

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:17.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which explains
my fear of drowning

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.265 line:92%
while my parents are having sex.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:24.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
How about we end on
a happy note?

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:28.975 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I want to be happy.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:31.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys are here in
the pursuit of happiness.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:33.379 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's noble.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I see somebody
that's happy in public,

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:36.516 line:92%
I'm not afraid to ask them

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:39.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to know why
because I want it.

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:42.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I saw a guy and he had it.
He just looked happy.

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I walked up to him
and I said,

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:47.794
"Sir, I need to know your secret
to life, to happiness."

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'll never forget
what he said.

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:52.599 line:92%
He said, "I'm nine years old."

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:54.601 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:58.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"Well, how'd you do that?"

00:03:58.304 --> 00:03:59.906 line:92%
And he said, "I'm scared."

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.908 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:04.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said,
"I'm scared, too, buddy."

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.178 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:06.813 line:92%
"It's a crazy world out there.

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:12.252
And I'll never forget the last
thing he said as he ran away

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.586 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Where's my mom?"

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:15.321 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:22.295 size:84% position:42% line:92%
